    <comment>New package herdr 0.9.5: terminal workspace manager for AI coding agents, builds its vendored libghostty-vt with zig 0.16.
- Update checks off by default: 0001-disable-background-update-checks-by-default.patch
- Legal: the embedded mp3 sounds carry no licence of their own upstream.
- x86_64 and aarch64 only: upstream's build.rs knows no other Zig target.</comment>
